'''Katsumi Orochi''' (愚地克巳, ''Orochi Katsumi'', '''Katsumi Orochi''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Katsumi Orochi
|image = E 727.png
|first appearance = [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Katsumi is a very simple enemy. Instead of annoying debuffs or high bulk, all he does is hit your units often and hard from a safe 450 range, meaning your normal backliner counters like [[Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Bahamut Cat]] aren't going to be getting very consistant hits in.

==Strategy==
Fight him similarly to [[Master A.]], by using tankers like [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan]] or rushers like [[Courier Cat]] and [[Fishman Cat]].

